			"notes": "EzWebhookSender is a simple Fabric mod for Minecraft 1.21.1 that lets server operators send custom messages to a Discord webhook directly from in‑game commands.\nIt’s designed to be lightweight, fast, and easy to configure.\n\n**Features**\n\n    Send any message to a Discord (for example) webhook using a single command\n\n    Store and update the webhook URL in‑game\n\n    Minimal, clean implementation with no extra dependencies\n\n    Server‑side only\n\nCommands\n\n    /webhook set <url> — saves the Discord webhook URL\n\n    /webhook send <message> — sends a custom message to the webhook\n\nPerfect for server notifications, admin tools, automation, or simple integrations."
